{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116098131502989312"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:29:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116100139878318293"], "id": "2116100139878318293", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 4587, "like_count": 58, "quote_count": 13, "reply_count": 38, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "全体起立 ❗️   发现一个 AI 非常有实用价值的场景\n\n用 AI 去管理邮箱里的邮件, 尤其对于我们这些订阅多个 AI 订阅工具的人来说,  只是是自己 AI 的钱花在那里了, 没准还能能省钱啊 \n\n刚翻了一遍自己的邮箱，发现里面已经攒了一串事情：\n\nChatGpt  收费提醒 、  DeepSeek 的 API 收费提醒、Cloudflare https://t.co/IN45qzCNL2", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116100139878318293"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-30T08:17:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116081933025472855"], "id": "2116081933025472855", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 1692, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115790774642303041", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这篇文章把 Wise 个人美户港户说透了：大陆身份也能开。\n\n核心三步：\n1. 有已验证的 Business，再开同体系个人户\n2. 填 TIN（中国税居用身份证号），首充同名转且附言别空\n3. 到账后美户港户才会下发 https://t.co/3D5sOgVUYT", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116081933025472855"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116067210422812673"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T07:19:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116067410201702894"], "id": "2116067410201702894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 488, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115626860226982157", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈哈,  这个 《一张纸对折多少能到月球?》 视频发到抖音,  还拿到了流量激励,  这个是不是很容易拿 ? ? ? https://t.co/LnJs9roiqy https://t.co/hkbeD4jQMq", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116067410201702894"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116061219178336256"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T06:55:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116061395347493324"], "id": "2116061395347493324", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1522, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot 本周版本更新一览, 从 0.75.5 -&gt; 0.78.1 \n\n几个能马上用上的点：\n\n1. Vault：存登录、卡、联系人，结账可直接调\n2. 1Password：你在 App 里审批，Bot 浏览器填，看不到密码\n3. 权限卡：Settings 统一管规则，Bot 还能在聊天里提议改规则\n4. Question Cards：一张卡分步问多个问题\n5. https://t.co/JwqZlxG3VE", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116061395347493324"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116049051133349888"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T06:06:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116049089075056802"], "id": "2116049089075056802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1631, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116042767784989103", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok Bot 现在能邀请好友,   好友2周的免费试用链接了 \n\nX 友们, 赶紧去看看有没有 https://t.co/ohVDpM5SZW https://t.co/xunqTtrL5q", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116049089075056802"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115873705230249984"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T05:16:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116036483757007151"], "id": "2116036483757007151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 641, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Neuralink（脑机接口公司，正在做「用想法说话」的语音恢复临床试验）工程师跑到一位受试者家里，干了 72 小时黑客松：白板出点子、当场做原型、当场测。\n\n目标就一件事：让用想法说话尽量少按按钮。\n\n线程和片子里亮出的几块：\n\n1.", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116036483757007151"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116030836516737024"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T04:54:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116030938304115170"], "id": "2116030938304115170", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 3168, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115944037488443690", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Cloris 做的 三家 personal agent 对比图,  非常详细了 https://t.co/r6R9PwLJjD https://t.co/TLfUlSMmMj", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116030938304115170"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116010949861851136"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T03:37:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116011646024130677"], "id": "2116011646024130677", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 5540, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "卧槽 ! ! !  腾讯这回对 workbuddy 扶持力度顶天了,  让其他各种应用都能和 WorkBuddy 协同 ,  还推出了个  Buddy One \n\n什么是 Buddy One？加入 Buddy One 后，Workbuddy 积分升级为Buddy One 积分，各应用间实现积分和数据共享。\n\n看大厂的一款产品受不受重视的分辨方法,  其实很简单 https://t.co/nBp3vzQFNo", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116011646024130677"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115971958219374592"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T01:11:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115974734957703677"], "id": "2115974734957703677", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 202, "impression_count": 27825, "like_count": 159, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 30}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109544824135467312", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "全体起立 ❗️❗️❗️   Rea 现在 40.8 万 Star ,   荣登今年新增 Github 最高星项目 ,  超越了  OpenClaw  39.3 万 Star \n \n一个 4 月才上线的项目，10 月直接冲到 40 万+ Stars，成为今年最火的开源项目之一。\n\n单月新增约 40 万 Stars，增长榜断层第一,  全站总 Stars 已进前 5–6\n\n2026 https://t.co/nXU0yLfedd https://t.co/d8taTJHOeT", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115974734957703677"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115964978197102592"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-30T00:34:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115965579274457601"], "id": "2115965579274457601", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 610, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115626860226982157", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "哈哈,   我也参加抖音 Vibe知识大赏的话题了,  看看到时候有多少播放量 \n\n昨天做的那个《一张纸折叠多少, 可以到月球?》 那个视频感觉很适合参加 Vibe 知识大赏 \n\n原本知识做给小孩科普的,   刚好这个太合适 Vibe 知识大赏这个主题了 \n\n用 AI , 把一个知识点变成一段视频 https://t.co/HFxHYepmuQ https://t.co/hkbeD4jQMq", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115965579274457601"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T23:35:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115950694599713110"], "id": "2115950694599713110", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1881, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115850175868727621", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "卧槽 ! ! !  感觉 Tibo 这轮营销不成功哈 \n\n先说要降,  然后又不降 \n\n哪些已经取消订阅 Pro 20  X 的 用户,  短时间不会回来呀 \n\n我都准备下个月降低订阅等级的\n\n这确实是利好  Pro 5 X 用户,  直接翻倍到 10 倍 https://t.co/UM0RFyqhq5", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115950694599713110"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115833522078498816"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T22:45:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115937975708324287"], "id": "2115937975708324287", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 10525, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Muse 10.0 来了 ,  收到更新提示了 \n\n重要的是依然不知道 Muse 这次 10.0 更新是更新的个什么 \n\n十分不喜欢 Muse , 这种每次版本升级都不告知升级什么的产品 https://t.co/FjMKkpXDkT", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115937975708324287"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110409849746141184"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:59:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115835802462646337"], "id": "2115835802462646337", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 676, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SpaceXAI 做 Cursor 和 Grok Bot 的 matt palmer 发了条约 11 分钟片子：用代码把 Slack 界面做成视频动效。\n\n做法不是拆 Slack 源码。给 Agent 一段参考视频，再在它自己的电脑里打开真 Slack，让它对着画面抠动效、缓动和交互。Agent 跑在 Cursor Cloud 的 Linux", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115835802462646337"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115827499850727425"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115828220591497345", "2115828504772370673"], "id": "2115828504772370673", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 4369, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "卧槽中的卧槽  ❗️❗️❗️  深夜重大发现 ,  Grok网页端聊天中现在可以直接  @ grok bot 中的任何一个bot 了 \n\n这尼玛硬是把 Grok 和 Bot 体系完全打通了 ,   这样太爽了吧 \n\n以后 grok 搜索的信息可以直接跟 Bot 互通,  省掉了复制、粘贴的这多一步的事情 https://t.co/22siYEyvJe", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115828504772370673"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T13:16:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115795008712475092"], "id": "2115795008712475092", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 974, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115779686697697557", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Grok Bot 日活连涨 16 天，是上线以来最长连涨。\n\n几个数字：\n- 9 月初不到 10 万日活\n- 到 10 月 26 日超过 60 万\n- 不到两个月翻了 6 倍多 https://t.co/jC7NC4ZAGp", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115795008712475092"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115763511200776192"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:14:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115764128375881791"], "id": "2115764128375881791", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 128, "impression_count": 35503, "like_count": 141, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 10}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115759993245110453", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "workbuddy 都支持浏览器操作了,    以后感觉用 codex 的场景更少了 \n\n要是 codex 还不给力点,   准备退订 Pro 套餐了 https://t.co/ppt7IkhJvv https://t.co/MQucY7k4IM", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115764128375881791"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T10:35:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115754472161030543"], "id": "2115754472161030543", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1759530111534243840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 240, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115754265180574033", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "源码地址: https://t.co/11NeplILEN", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115754472161030543"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T10:35:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115754265180574033"], "id": "2115754265180574033", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 649, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115665851403673788", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Ayi 用 Opus 5.5 两小时搓「情商外挂」的开源作业。\n\n干的事很简单：发送前把带火气的草稿改成对方听得进去的话。先标刺耳词，再给可直接发的版本，温和 / 坚定 / 直接三档，选坚定立场不缩水。规则来自他开源的《非暴力沟通》Skill，GitHub 180+ Star。\n\n工具是零依赖本地网页，跑在 https://t.co/Cl939ges5Q", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115754265180574033"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115738640454459392"]}, "created_at": "2026-10-29T09:33:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115738775494205469"], "id": "2115738775494205469", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1770, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "说个暴论:   每一个 AI 群,  都必谈的一个话题 \n\n如何防止 Claude 不被封 ,  怎么能用安全的用上 Claude\n\n群里小伙伴的一个解题之法,  直接拿一台主机啥也不干,  就专门登 claude https://t.co/pCdOHPa7sV", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115738775494205469"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T08:25:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115721720384639220"], "id": "2115721720384639220", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 1714, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115398432580042876", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "这篇文章把用 WorkBuddy 做古人同台说唱《走慢一点》的视频讲清楚了 \n\n参考《过来人》的接唱形式，诸葛亮、辛弃疾、李清照一人接一句，唱的是打工人的心事，不是背古诗。音乐放 Suno，其他用 WorkBuddy 连 LibTV 往下推 https://t.co/83tjWQuQuv", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115721720384639220"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T07:39:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115709973124571572"], "id": "2115709973124571572", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 895, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115705702832578800", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "ChatGPT Pro 每月 API 额度领取保姆级教程来了\n\n10 月 28 日 @OpenAIDevs 说了：符合条件的 Pro 和 Business，每月最高能领 500 美元 API 额度，拿去搭应用和 Agent。\n\n能领多少看档位：Pro 100 / 200 / 500，送的额度和月费一样多。Business 按席位算，工作区合起来封顶 https://t.co/qII71GGtNh", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2115709973124571572"}, {"created_at": "2026-10-29T0